  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "From above, the blessed land is covered with innumerable large and small deep pools in mixed blue and green, like stars in the sky. Each pool holds different water that raises aquatic species, and beside one pool sits a small hut. Guests note the land has no mountains or rivers.",
      "chapters": [
        657
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Visiting Gu Immortals note that Dong Fang tribe fish groups and water vegetation are famous in treasure yellow heaven. Dong Fang Yi Kong says the land has been in operation for just over six thousand years. It is the headquarters of the Huang Jin family’s Dong Fang tribe, a super force. The small hut beside one pool is the rank six Immortal Gu House Modest Thatched Hut, where Dong Fang Chang Fan hosts northern plains righteous path Gu Immortals.",
      "chapters": [
        657
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "fac_dong_fang_tribe",
        "loc_treasure_yellow_heaven",
        "char_dong_fang_yi_kong",
        "fac_huang_jin_bloodline",
        "sys_immortal_gu_house",
        "house_modest_thatched_hut",
        "char_dong_fang_chang_fan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Miniscule Mountain needs large amounts of earth qi to keep its form, so placing it long-term in a Gu Immortal’s aperture burdens that aperture’s heaven and earth qi. For that reason it is placed in Jade Pool blessed land most of the time, because the land sits on Northern Plains ground and can draw endless outside heaven and earth qi.",
      "chapters": [
        799
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
